# Path Dependency CI

RULE: Clone path dependencies to `../repo-name` in CI. pyproject.toml must use `path = "../repo-name"`. Never use `deps/` for path deps.
WHY: Local workspace has repos as siblings; CI clone to `../` creates same layout. `deps/` breaks `uv pip install -e ".[dev]"`.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md

DO:
  git clone ... ../unified-cloud-services
  uv pip install --system -e ../unified-cloud-services
  uv pip install --system -e ".[dev]"

NEVER:
  Clone to deps/ when pyproject expects ../
  Add checkout to unified-cloud-services (zero path deps)
